    "index": 1,
    "heading": "Always on. Always local.",
    "html": "<section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\"> <div class=\"grid-bg\"></div> <div class=\"hero-glow\"></div> <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\"> <div class=\"hero-copy\"> <span class=\"eyebrow\">VoIP · Business Internet · Managed IT</span> <h1>Always on.<br><span class=\"g\">Always local.</span></h1> <p class=\"sub\">Business phone, internet, and IT from one Michigan provider — engineered so you never miss a call, a customer, or a beat.</p> <div class=\"cta-row\"> <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#contact\">Get a Free Quote →</a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#services\">See What We Do</a> </div> <div class=\"trust\"> <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> Locally owned &amp; operated</div> <div class=\"sep\"></div> <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span> One provider, one bill</div> </div> </div> <aside class=\"support-panel\"> <div class=\"sp-head\"> <div class=\"sp-title\">Client Support Center</div> <div class=\"sp-sub\"><span class=\"live\"></span> Online · 24/7 US-based support</div> </div> <a class=\"support-row\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#\"> <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v6\"></path><path d=\"M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H3z\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"lbl\">Remote Support</span> <span class=\"arw\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></span> </a> <a class=\"support-row\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#\"> <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"lbl\">Open a Support Ticket</span> <span class=\"arw\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></span> </a> <a class=\"support-row\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#\"> <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg></span> <span class=\"lbl\">Pay Your Invoice</span> <span class=\"arw\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></span> </a> <a class=\"support-row\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#\"> <span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"lbl\">Client Portal</span> <span class=\"arw\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></span> </a> <a class=\"support-row\" href=\"tel:+18553132300\"> <span class=\"ic\"><svg widt