  {
    "index": 2,
    "heading": "Everything your business needs to stay connected.",
    "html": "<section class=\"sec\" id=\"services\"> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"sec-head\"> <span class=\"eyebrow\">What we do</span> <h2>Everything your business needs to stay connected.</h2> <p class=\"lead\">Voice, data, internet, and IT — designed, provisioned, and supported by one local team.</p> </div> <div class=\"cards\"> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.9.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg></div> <h3>Hosted VoIP</h3> <p>A full cloud phone system with multi-location extension dialing, auto-attendants, and voicemail-to-email — no on-site PBX to buy or maintain.</p> </div> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"17\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></div> <h3>Tailored Solutions</h3> <p>No two businesses run the same. We design and build a communications and IT system around how yours actually works — not a one-size-fits-all package.</p> </div> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 13a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"20\"></line></svg></div> <h3>Business Internet &amp; Fiber</h3> <p>Dedicated high-speed connectivity — up to 1&nbsp;Gbps on fiber — built for business uptime, not best-effort. Redundant options available.</p> </div> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 9V2h12v7\"></path><path d=\"M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div> <h3>Virtual Fax (FaxBridge)</h3> <p>Send and receive faxes by email and web — no machine, no dedicated line. Reliable and compliant for healthcare, legal, and finance.</p> <a class=\"card-link\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/faxbridge/\">Learn about FaxBridge →</a> </div> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div> <h3>Managed IT</h3> <p>Network management, security, and responsive support from a local team — so your technology just works and someone's always accountable.</p> </div> <div class=\"card\"> <div class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"></path><path d=\"M5 12.859a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 16.429a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"></path></svg></div> <h3>4G LTE Failover</h3> <p>Automatic wireless backup keeps you online when the wired line goes down. Your phones keep ringing and your business keeps running.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>",
