  {
    "index": 3,
    "heading": "One provider instead of four.",
    "html": "<section class=\"sec why\" id=\"why\"> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"grid2\"> <div> <span class=\"eyebrow\">Why Net Express</span> <h2>One provider instead of four.</h2> <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Most businesses juggle separate vendors for phone, internet, fax, and IT — four bills, four support numbers, and finger-pointing when something breaks. We deliver all of it as a single, integrated service, backed by a local Michigan team that's accountable end to end.</p> <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://gonetexpress.netlify.app/#contact\">Talk to a specialist</a></div> </div> <ul class=\"checklist\"> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> One monthly bill</li> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> One number for support</li> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> Keep your phone numbers</li> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> No PBX hardware to buy</li> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> Multi-location dialing</li> <li><span class=\"check\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span> Local, US-based team</li> </ul> </div> </div> </section>",
