    "html": "<section class=\"sec contact\" id=\"contact\"> <div class=\"wrap\"> <div class=\"grid2\"> <div> <span class=\"eyebrow\">Get connected</span> <h2>Let's simplify your business communications.</h2> <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Talk to a Michigan-based specialist. We'll design the right phone, internet, and IT setup for your business — and handle the switch.</p> <div class=\"cta-row\"> <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+18553132300\">Call (855) 313-2300</a> <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"mailto:support@gonetexpress.com\">Email us</a> </div> </div> <div class=\"contact-card\"> <div class=\"crow\"><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.9.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"k\">Call us</div><a class=\"v\" href=\"tel:+18553132300\">(855) 313-2300</a></div></div> <div class=\"crow\"><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-10 5L2 7\"></path></svg></span><div><div class=\"k\">Email</div><a class=\"v\" href=\"mailto:support@gonetexpress.com\">support@gonetexpress.com</a></div></div> <div class=\"crow\"><span class=\"ic\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circl